OL,3,GNEWSADarts Grand Slam a '#3.7m boost   
OL,4,Afor city economy'                      
OL,6,FThis year's Grand Slam of Darts has    
OL,7,Fboosted host city Wolverhampton's      
OL,8,Feconomy by #3.7m, according to the     
OL,9,Fcouncil.                               
OL,11,FFigures show about 20,000 people       
OL,12,Fvisited the area for the sell-out,     
OL,13,Fnine-day event which ended on Sunday.  
OL,15,FHeld at the WV Active Aldersley venue, 
OL,16,Fit saw the world's best players,       
OL,17,Fincluding Luke Littler, battle it out  
OL,18,Fto clinch the title, with Gerwyn Price 
OL,19,Fwinning the competition for the fourth 
OL,20,Ftime.                                  
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
