OL,3,GNEWSADarts Grand Slam a '#3.7m boost   
OL,4,Afor city economy'                      
OL,6,FStephen Simkins, city council leader,  
OL,7,Fsaid: "Wolverhampton is the spiritual  
OL,8,Fhome of the Grand Slam of Darts and we 
OL,9,Fare proud and excited to host the best 
OL,10,Fdarts players in the world and their   
OL,11,Ffantastic, passionate fans."           
